description=SD730 Smart Scheduler + Neural Scheduler v3.1.1. Patching/inference/binding are Python-free (awk/shell). MODEL TRAINING requires Python3 (py2droid or Termux; numpy optional - pure-python fallback included). k/cap scene model (210 params) + thread-level dual-module model (657 params) with frame-time feedback. v3.1.1: fixed thermal sensor misread (lmh-dcvs 75000), --force now bypasses standby/data gates with 85C hard ceiling, real-time training logs (-u).
